{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04743","headline":"奉和圣制经河上公庙应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制经河上公庙应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河上无名老，知非汉代人。\n先探道德要，留待圣明辰。\n玄妙爲天下，清虚用谷神。\n化将和气一，风与太初邻。\n灵庙观遗像，仙歌入至真。\n皇心齐万物，何处不同尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}